{"title":"Connecticut State Association of Mathematics Leagues","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Connecticut State Association of Mathematics Leagues</b> (<b>CSAML</b>) is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization bringing together <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=High_school&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"High school (page does not exist)\">high school</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_league&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math league (page does not exist)\">math leagues</a> from around Connecticut:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Capital Area Math League</li>\n<li>Eastern Connecticut Math League</li>\n<li>Fairfield County Math League</li>\n<li>Greater Middlesex County Math League</li>\n<li>Greater New Haven Math League</li></ul>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Historical_Results\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Historical Results</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Small_School_State_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Small School State Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Medium_School_State_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Medium School State Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Large_School_State_Champions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Large School State Champions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Individual_Winners_(Seniors)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Individual Winners (Seniors)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Individual_Winners_(Juniors)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Individual Winners (Juniors)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Individual_Winners_(Sophomores)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Individual Winners (Sophomores)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Individual_Winners_(Freshmen_&amp;_below)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Individual Winners (Freshmen &amp; below)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Historical_Results\">Historical Results</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Connecticut_State_Association_of_Mathematics_Leagues&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Historical Results\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Small_School_State_Champions\">Small School State Champions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Connecticut_State_Association_of_Mathematics_Leagues&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Small School State Champions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>2026- Brunswick School</li>\n<li>2025- Brunswick School</li>\n<li>2024- Brunswick School</li>\n<li>2023- Brunswick School</li>\n<li>2022- Brunswick School</li>\n<li>2021- Brunswick School</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Medium_School_State_Champions\">Medium School State Champions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl